<title>FRANCE: Carrefour 1996 sales 175.64 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Carrefour 1996 sales 175.64 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				     175,644    up 6.9 pct</p>
<p>     - in France				 103,644    up 3.0 pct</p>
<p>    December turnover			   20,999    up 6.4 pct</p>
<p>     - in France				  11,846   down 1.2 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Carrefour reported its full-year sales, taxes included, in a statement.</p>
<p>It said it opened a 13th store in Mexico in December (96,770 square feet in Hermosillo), and its first store in Hong Kong (31,180 square feet in Hang Fa Chuen).</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
